          "kicker": "Coaching vacancy",
          "heading": "Mick Byrne departed Fiji head coach role in April by mutual agreement",
          "body": "Fiji continue to seek a permanent head coach following Mick Byrne's departure by mutual agreement in April. The Australian, who was appointed in 2024, stepped down to allow Fiji Rugby to pursue a new direction, stating it had been 'an honour to work with the Flying Fijians players and staff'. CEO Koli Sewabu confirmed the exit ahead of the July Nations Championship, leaving the post vacant as Fiji prepare to face France."
