          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Joe Carpenter targets George Furbank duel to reignite England ambitions",
          "body": "Sale full-back Joe Carpenter is using this weekend’s clash against Harlequins as a direct audition to challenge George Furbank for the England jersey. Carpenter, who has not featured for Steve Borthwick since July 2025, has benefited from a full pre-season and is currently among the Premiership’s most prolific defenders beaten. Regarding his motivation for the head-to-head, Carpenter said, \"Yeah I'd say so, in a certain aspect,\" noting that outshining his direct rival is key to forcing his way into the squad for November."
