          "kicker": "Training insight",
          "heading": "Victor Wembanyama trains with French rugby club to develop physical strength",
          "body": "NBA superstar Victor Wembanyama recently spent part of his off-season training with Provence Rugby. The 22-year-old sought to improve his game through the physical and mental rigours of rugby, participating in line-out drills, tackling sessions and passing practice alongside the second-tier side. Wembanyama praised the camaraderie of the squad, noting that he was inspired by the unity he witnessed. The basketball star previously worked on stability and movement patterns during his visit to the French club in August."
