          "heading": "Aoife Wafer ruled out of Ireland women’s squad for South Africa",
          "body": "The Ireland women’s team will travel to South Africa for their upcoming WXV Global Series fixtures without star back-rower Aoife Wafer. The 23-year-old Harlequins player, who missed the recent consecutive victories against Japan due to a minor training injury, has failed to recover in time for the two-match tour. Scott Bemand’s 30-player squad, captained by Erin King, will head to Cape Town later this month as they look to build on their current momentum."
