          "body": "As the Azzurri continue their preparations for the upcoming fixture against South Africa, they look to improve on their previous meeting with the Springboks. In their last encounter, which took place at home during the November 2025 international window, Italy suffered a 32-14 defeat. The squad currently sits 11th on the log following three losses to open their campaign, as they aim to register their first points against the reigning world champions."
