          "kicker": "Heritage collection",
          "heading": "Scottish Rugby and Macron launch new vintage-inspired 'Archive Collection' range",
          "body": "Scottish Rugby has partnered with Macron to release 'The Archive Collection', a range reimagining fan-favourite kits from the 1990s and early 2000s. Filmed at the historic Inverleith Sports Ground, the campaign features current internationals such as Ewan Ashman and Pierre Schoeman alongside legends including Chris Paterson and Jason White. Head of retail David Salisbury stated, “We decided this was the right time to bring back and reimagine some of these favourites,” noting the goal is to connect historic visual identities with modern relevance."
