          "heading": "Shaun Edwards joins Argentina as defence coach until 2027 World Cup",
          "body": "Felipe Contepomi has confirmed the appointment of Shaun Edwards as Argentina’s new defence coach, a move that secures the former France assistant’s services until the 2027 World Cup in Australia. Edwards, who will begin his role at the end of October alongside returning forwards coach Mario Ledesma, expressed his excitement to bring international experience to the squad. Contepomi noted that both men arrive with immense experience and understand what is required to compete at the highest level of the game."
