          "body": "Wallabies coach Les Kiss has opted for continuity by keeping Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii on the wing for the Bledisloe Cup opener at Eden Park. The decision follows a successful shift from the midfield during the recent victory over the Springboks in Perth. Kiss emphasised the importance of maintaining the back-three combination, noting that the aerial game will be vital against the All Blacks. The coach remains optimistic about the impact of Suaalii’s physicality in a venue where Australia has not tasted victory since 1986."
