          "heading": "Japan Sakura Sevens Reclaim Asian Games Gold In Nagoya Victory",
          "body": "Japan’s women secured gold at the 20th Asian Games in Aichi-Nagoya, defeating defending champions China 10-5 in a tightly contested final. The Sakura Sevens successfully reclaimed the title they last held two Games ago. While the host nation’s men were defeated in the semifinal by China, they recovered to claim bronze by beating Korea 17-5. The victory for the women highlights a dominant performance across the tournament, reinforcing their position within the continental rugby sevens landscape."
